      "htmlContent": "<ul class=\"checklist-items\">\n<li class=\"checklist-item\"><label class=\"checklist-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\"  class=\"task-checkbox\" data-text=\"Analyse du besoin et proposition fonctionnelle et technique (1 à 2 pages)\"> <span class=\"chk-text\">Analyse du besoin et proposition fonctionnelle et technique (1 à 2 pages)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"checklist-item\"><label class=\"checklist-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\"  class=\"task-checkbox\" data-text=\"Product Vision Board et Product Goal\"> <span class=\"chk-text\">Product Vision Board et Product Goal</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"checklist-item\"><label class=\"checklist-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\"  class=\"task-checkbox\" data-text=\"Impact map\"> <span class=\"chk-text\">Impact map</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"checklist-item\"><label class=\"checklist-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\"  class=\"task-checkbox\" data-text=\"Story map avec 3 releases\"> <span class=\"chk-text\">Story map avec 3 releases</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"checklist-item\"><label class=\"checklist-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\"  class=\"task-checkbox\" data-text=\"Product Backlog priorisé de 20 user stories minimum (Trello, Notion ou Airtable)\"> <span class=\"chk-text\">Product Backlog priorisé de 20 user stories minimum (Trello, Notion ou Airtable)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"checklist-item\"><label class=\"checklist-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\"  class=\"task-checkbox\" data-text=\"User flow et 3 wireframes\"> <span class=\"chk-text\">User flow et 3 wireframes</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"checklist-item\"><label class=\"checklist-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\"  class=\"task-checkbox\" data-text=\"Roadmap Now / Next / Later reliée aux OKR\"> <span class=\"chk-text\">Roadmap Now / Next / Later reliée aux OKR</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"checklist-item\"><label class=\"checklist-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\"  class=\"task-checkbox\" data-text=\"Espace de documentation projet structuré\"> <span class=\"chk-text\">Espace de documentation projet structuré</span></label></li>\n</ul>",
